<title>UK: M&amp;S to report on Xmas sales on Jan 29.</title>
<headline>M&amp;S to report on Xmas sales on Jan 29.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>British clothing and food stores group Marks &amp; Spencer Plc said on Thursday it would release its Christmas trading statement on January 29 in the morning.</p>
<p>The company said the statement would include information for the four months from September 30, 1996, to January 25, 1997, including the sale period.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
